🎤 VOICE COMMANDS QUICK REFERENCE

Movement (with optional duration):
  • "forward [for] [X seconds]" - Move forward
  • "backward / back [for] [X seconds]" - Move backward
  • "turn left / left [for] [X seconds]" - Turn left
  • "turn right / right [for] [X seconds]" - Turn right

  Duration can be digits (1-99) or words (one, two, three... twenty five)
  Default: 1 second if not specified

Actions (instant):
  • "sit" - Robot sits down
  • "stand" - Robot stands up
  • "walk" - Set walking action
  • "stop" - Stop all movement immediately

Modes:
  • "manual mode / enter manual / go manual" - Manual control mode

🤖 ROBOT SETUP (Vision 60)

1. Install system dependencies:
   sudo apt install -y espeak alsa-utils

2. Install Python packages:
   pip install flask flask-cors prometheus-client requests numpy opencv-python pyproj

3. Start backend (after sourcing ROS2):
   cd ~/flask_ros2
   python3 move14.py

💻 LISTENER SETUP (Laptop/PC)

1. Install system dependencies:
   Linux: sudo apt install -y ffmpeg portaudio19-dev python3-dev
   macOS: brew install ffmpeg portaudio

2. Install Python packages:
   pip install openai-whisper torch pyaudio requests

3. Configure robot IP in VoiceControl4.py:
   FLASK_API = "http://<ROBOT_IP>:5002"

4. Run listener:
   python3 VoiceControl4.py

⚙️ CONFIGURATION

VoiceControl4.py:
  • VOICE_FLASK_API: Robot backend URL (default: http://127.0.0.1:5002)
  • ENABLE_TTS: Enable local text-to-speech (default: False)
  • whisper.load_model(): Model size - tiny/base/small/medium/large
    - tiny: fastest, less accurate
    - large: slowest, most accurate
    - base: good balance (default)

move14.py:
  • ENABLE_TTS: Robot speaks back using espeak
  • ROS_CAMERA_BASE_URL: MJPEG server for camera proxy
  • USE_LZ4: Enable LZ4 compression for point clouds

🔧 TROUBLESHOOTING

Robot not responding:
  curl http://<ROBOT_IP>:5002/status

Microphone issues:
  - Verify portaudio is installed
  - Test microphone with system audio tools

Slow transcription:
  - Use smaller Whisper model (tiny or base)
  - Check CPU/GPU resources

Commands not recognized:
  - Speak clearly with pauses
  - Check command syntax above
  - Commands are case-insensitive

🌐 API ENDPOINTS

Commands:
  POST /command - Send movement/action/mode commands
  POST /mpc/goal - Send MPC goal
  POST /command/send_local_goal - Send local goal
  POST /command/send_goal - Send global goal

Status & Telemetry:
  GET /status - Robot status
  GET /gps - GPS data
  GET /imu - IMU data
  GET /odom - Odometry data
  GET /metrics - System metrics

Point Clouds:
  GET /pointcloud - Full point cloud
  GET /obstmap - Obstacle map
  GET /pointcloud_compressed - LZ4 compressed
  GET /obstmap_compressed - LZ4 compressed

Camera:
  GET /proxy_camera_feed/<camera> - Video stream
  GET /proxy_camera_snapshot/<camera> - Snapshot

